{"id":"tr-10-001","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":[],"groups":{},"text":"big island in the middle, tan colour","wires":[{"span":"big island in the middle, tan colour","trigger":"big island","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","size":"large","position":"center"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"A clear create request (big = large, middle = center); tan is not a legend colour, so it is dropped."}}
{"id":"tr-10-002","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1"],"groups":{},"text":"now a ship, small brown one, bottom left out at sea","wires":[{"span":"a ship, small brown one, bottom left","trigger":"a ship","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","size":"small","color":"brown","position":"bottomLeft"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"A clear create request with size, colour and canvas place, so [] is wrong."}}
{"id":"tr-10-003","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2"],"groups":{},"text":"Skull Cove on the west side of the island, a gray circle","wires":[{"span":"Skull Cove on the west side of the island, a gray circle","trigger":"Skull Cove","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"circle","color":"gray","label":"Skull Cove","position":"leftOf","anchor":"mention(size=large)"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"'west side of the island' places it relative to the island (leftOf, anchored by a mention), not at the canvas left; the verbless trigger is the span's leading words."}}
{"id":"tr-10-004","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3"],"groups":{},"text":"and a red star where the treasure is, top of the island. call it X","wires":[{"span":"a red star where the treasure is, top of the island","trigger":"a red star","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","shape":"star","color":"red","position":"onTop","anchor":"mention(size=large)"}},{"span":"call it X","trigger":"call","type":"command","args":{"action":"rename","target":"$new","name":"X"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"'top of the island' places it on the island (onTop, anchored by a mention), not at the canvas top."}}
{"id":"tr-10-005","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X"],"groups":{},"text":"dotted line from the ship to Skull Cove","wires":[{"span":"dotted line from the ship to Skull Cove","trigger":"dotted line","type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"mention(color=brown,size=small)","to":"mention(label=Skull Cove)","style":"dotted","arrow":"none"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"A new dotted line is a connect with arrow=none ('line'), so [] is wrong."}}
{"id":"tr-10-006","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X"],"groups":{},"text":"hm that island is huge, it covers the ship almost","wires":[]}
{"id":"tr-10-007","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X"],"groups":{},"text":"smaller. no a bit bigger than that","wires":[{"span":"a bit bigger than that","trigger":"bigger","type":"command","args":{"action":"resize","target":"mention(size=large)","scale":"1.25"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"Self-correction keeps the final wish, and 'a bit bigger' is resize with scale 1.25."}}
{"id":"tr-10-008","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X"],"groups":{},"text":"three palm trees, green, along the south beach","wires":[{"span":"three palm trees, green, along the south beach","trigger":"three palm trees","type":"command","args":{"action":"create","object":"tree","count":"3","color":"green","position":"below","anchor":"mention(recency=oldest)"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"own","why":"'south beach' is below the island, but after the resize mention(size=large) picks nothing; the island is the oldest shape, so mention(recency=oldest) picks exactly it."}}
{"id":"tr-10-009","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X","Tree","Tree2","Tree3"],"groups":{},"text":"Then the trail. Cove to the first palm, palm to the second, and on to X","wires":[{"span":"Cove to the first palm, palm to the second, and on to X","trigger":"Cove to","type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"mention(label=Skull Cove),mention(color=green,recency=oldest),mention(color=green),X","pairing":"chain"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"opus","why":"'A to B, B to C' is one connect with the chain; B leaves out two links. A's engine errors only follow the earlier failed step."}}
{"id":"tr-10-010","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X","Tree","Tree2","Tree3"],"groups":{},"text":"wait the trail is straight lines, pirates don't walk like that. can they be dashed too","wires":[{"span":"can they be dashed too","trigger":"be dashed","type":"command","args":{"action":"set","from":"mention(label=Skull Cove),mention(color=green,quantifier=all)","to":"mention(color=green,quantifier=all),X","style":"dashed"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"own","why":"'they' is the three trail lines and must be written as exactly them. A's kind=edge quantifier=all also restyles the ship line, B covers one link only."}}
{"id":"tr-10-011","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X","Tree","Tree2","Tree3"],"groups":{},"unreliable":true,"text":"Undo that","wires":[{"span":"Undo that","trigger":"Undo","type":"command","args":{"action":"undo"}}]}
{"id":"tr-10-012","domain":"pirate treasure map","kind":"session","session":"pirate-map","names":["circle1","circle2","circle3","X"],"groups":{},"unreliable":true,"text":"no I meant undo the dashed, keep the trail","wires":[{"span":"undo the dashed","trigger":"undo","type":"command","args":{"action":"set","from":"mention(label=Skull Cove),mention(color=green,quantifier=all)","to":"mention(color=green,quantifier=all),X","style":"solid"}}],"adjudicated":{"chose":"own","why":"The wish inside the complaint is an un-dashed trail that stays, and after 'Undo that' a bare undo would step back toward removing it, so this sets the trail lines solid. B covers one link only."}}
